hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1415","Muhammad bin Yahya told us, Nu`aym bin Hammad and Ibrahim bin Hamza told us, they said: Abdul Aziz, who is the son of Muhammad, told us on the authority of Amara He is Ibn Ghaziyah, on the authority of Abbad bin Tamim, on the authority of Abdullah bin Zayd, who said: “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, asked for water.” A black khamisah, so the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, wanted to take it from the bottom and put it on the top, but when it became heavy for him He turned it upon his shoulders.” Ibrahim bin Hamza said: On his shoulders."
